# Rename the tag #concept to #idea from the palette (recipe.run): pick rename-tag, fill from and
# to, see every file's diff, cancel once, then apply; the workspace's tags read #idea, and u
# undoes the whole recipe. tests/drive.rs checks the files after.
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
wait-for example-workspace 35 notes
keys :
type recipe
wait-for recipe.run
keys enter
wait-for rename-tag
expect rename a tag everywhere
keys enter
wait-for Recipe · rename-tag
expect the tag to rename (its nested tags follow)
type concept
keys enter
wait-for Tab next · ⏎ preview
type two words
keys enter
wait-for ! to: "two words" isn't a tag
keys backspace backspace backspace backspace backspace backspace backspace backspace backspace
type idea
keys enter
wait-for Changes 13 tags in 13 files:
expect Recipe · rename-tag from=concept to=idea
expect Concepts/Cinder Cone
expect 2 - tags: [concept, volcano-type]
expect 2 + tags: [idea, volcano-type]
expect ⏎ apply · Esc cancel · ↑↓ scroll · u undoes it after
screen
keys n
wait-for recipe cancelled, nothing was changed
keys #
wait-for tag
type concep
keys tab
wait-for tag: #concept
keys esc
wait-gone tag: #concept
keys :
type recipe
wait-for recipe.run
keys enter
wait-for rename-tag
keys enter
wait-for Recipe · rename-tag
type concept
keys tab
type idea
keys enter
wait-for Changes 13 tags in 13 files:
keys pagedown pagedown pagedown pagedown pagedown pagedown
wait-for Concepts/ʻAʻā
keys enter
wait-for rename-tag from=concept to=idea: changed 13 tags in 13 files · u undo
keys #
wait-for tag
type ide
keys tab
wait-for tag: #idea
keys esc
wait-gone tag: #idea
keys u
wait-for recipe undone: rename-tag from=concept to=idea · 13 files as they were
keys #
wait-for tag
type concep
keys tab
wait-for tag: #concept
keys esc
wait-gone tag: #concept
keys :
type recipe
wait-for recipe.run
keys enter
wait-for rename-tag
keys enter
wait-for Recipe · rename-tag
type concept
keys tab
type idea
keys enter
wait-for Changes 13 tags in 13 files:
keys y
wait-for changed 13 tags in 13 files · u undo
keys q
exits 0
